{#
  BeMart 商品詳細 — EC-CUBE goProduct.

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 default-theme `Product/detail.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/default/Product/detail.twig).

  Markup skeleton, `ec-productRole` / `ec-grid2` / `ec-sliderItemRole`
  / `ec-price` / `ec-numberInput` / `ec-modal` classes and the block
  structure are kept verbatim from EC-CUBE. The dynamic bindings are
  rebound to the Product resource body (src/Resource/Page/Product.php):
    productCode, productName, price02, stock, stockFind, mainImage, form

  FORM page (the add-to-cart action). EC-CUBE renders the add-cart
  quantity input through `AddCartType` + `form_widget(form.quantity)`;
  BeMart renders it through a real `AddCartForm` (an AbstractForm),
  exposed by the Product resource as `body.form`:

    {{ form.input('productCode')|raw }}  <- hidden, seeded w/ productCode
    {{ form.input('quantity')|raw }}    <- real number <input>, min=1

  Validation authority stays with the Be Framework Becoming chain (the
  Cart add-item Input) — the form is a field-definition + renderer.

  The `{% block stylesheet %}` (the slick-slider CSS) is ported
  verbatim — it is static markup with no data binding.

  厳密移植 (Grade-C) SCOPE — BeMart's Product body is the thin
  projection `productCode / productName / price02 / stock`. EC-CUBE's
  detail.twig renders much more off the full `Product` entity; those
  fields are genuinely absent from BeMart's data and are OMITTED (never
  invented), each enumerated as an explained residual in
  tests/Resource/ProductHtmlRenderTest.php:

   - `Product.ProductImage` — BeMart does not yet have a product-image
     table/join. The `item_visual` gallery therefore renders one
     presentation-side `mainImage` from ProductImageCatalog, falling back
     to EC-CUBE's `no_image_product` placeholder for image-less fixtures.
   - `Product.hasProductClass` / `getPrice01*` / `ProductClass` — the
     規格 (class) price ranges, the `classcategory_id1/2` selects.
     No ProductClass join in scope; the price renders as the single
     `price02` value and the class selects do not render.
   - `Product.Tags` / `Product.ProductCategories` — tag chips and the
     related-category breadcrumb. No tag / category join in scope.
   - `Product.description_detail` / `description_list` / `freearea` —
     the rich product description + free HTML area. No description
     field in scope.
   - `Product.code_min` / `code_max` — EC-CUBE shows a code RANGE for
     class products; BeMart shows the single `productCode`.
   - `BaseInfo.option_favorite_product` + `is_favorite` — the
     favorite-product feature flag + per-customer favorite state.
     BeMart has no BaseInfo / session-favorite aggregation, so the
     add/remove-favorite control is OMITTED. The `#doAddFavorite` /
     `#doRemoveFavorite` transitions ARE declared on the Product
     resource (ALPS remediation f01e1ae); rendering the button needs a
     Favorite vertical-slice enrichment — flagged as a follow-up.
   - The `{% block javascript %}` — the slick-slider init, the
     add-cart AJAX handler, the `eccube.classCategories` payload and
     the schema.org JSON-LD. EC-CUBE client-side behavior + SEO
     structured data: it depends on EC-CUBE's bundled `eccube.js` /
     slick plugin / per-request CSRF / `Product` entity joins that
     BeMart does not ship. Like the frame's `meta.twig` SEO fragment,
     it is OMITTED as EC-CUBE-runtime-only and enumerated as residual.

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `asset('x')` -> `/x`; `canonical-url route, params)` -> `/{route}?{query}`.
   - `price` filter -> JPY NumberFormatter.
#}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% set body_class = 'product_page' %}
{% set route = 'product' %}
{% set title = productName %}

{% block stylesheet %}
    <style>

        .slick-slider {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .slick-dots {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -45px;
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0;
            list-style: none;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .slick-dots li {
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            margin: 0 5px;
            padding: 0;

            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .slick-dots li button {
            font-size: 0;
            line-height: 0;
            display: block;
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            padding: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: transparent;
            border: 0;
            outline: none;
            background: transparent;
        }

        .slick-dots li button:hover,
        .slick-dots li button:focus {
            outline: none;
        }

        .slick-dots li button:hover:before,
        .slick-dots li button:focus:before {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .slick-dots li button:before {
            content: " ";
            line-height: 20px;
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            opacity: .25;
            background-color: black;
            border-radius: 50%;

        }

        .slick-dots li.slick-active button:before {
            opacity: .75;
            background-color: black;
        }

        .slick-dots li button.thumbnail img {
            width: 0;
            height: 0;
        }

    </style>
{% endblock %}

{% block main %}
    <div class="ec-productRole">
        <div class="ec-grid2">
            <div class="ec-grid2__cell">
                <div class="ec-sliderItemRole">

                    <div class="item_visual">
                        <div class="slide-item"><img src="{{ asset(mainImage|default('assets/img/common/no_image_product.png'), 'save_image') }}" alt="{{ productName }}" width="550" height="550"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item_nav">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ec-grid2__cell">
                <div class="ec-productRole__profile">
                    {# 商品名 #}
                    <div class="ec-productRole__title">
                        <h2 class="ec-headingTitle">{{ productName }}</h2>
                    </div>
                    {# タグ #}
                    <ul class="ec-productRole__tags">
                        {% for tagName in tagNames|default([]) %}
                            <li class="ec-productRole__tag tag_{{ loop.index }}">{{ tagName }}</li>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </ul>
                    {# 販売価格 #}
                    <div class="ec-productRole__price">
                        <div class="ec-price">
                            <span class="ec-price__price">{{ price02|price }}</span>
                            <span class="ec-price__tax">税込</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    {# 商品コード #}
                    <div class="ec-productRole__code">
                        商品コード： <span class="product-code-default">{{ productCode }}</span>
                    </div>
                    {% if categoryNames|default([]) is not empty %}
                        <div class="ec-productRole__category">
                            カテゴリ：
                            {% for categoryName in categoryNames %}
                                <span>{{ categoryName }}</span>{% if not loop.last %} / {% endif %}
                            {% endfor %}
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if classNames|default([]) is not empty %}
                        <div class="ec-productRole__class">
                            規格：{{ classNames|join(' / ') }}
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}
                    <form action="/cart/item" method="post" id="form1" name="form1">
                        <input type="hidden" name="csrfToken" value="{{ csrfToken|default('') }}">
                        {% if stockFind %}
                            <div class="ec-productRole__actions">
                                <div class="ec-numberInput"><span>数量</span>
                                    {{ form.input('quantity')|raw }}
                                    {{ form.error('quantity') }}
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="ec-productRole__btn">
                                <button type="submit" class="ec-blockBtn--action add-cart">
                                    カートに入れる
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        {% else %}
                            <div class="ec-productRole__btn">
                                <button type="button" class="ec-blockBtn--action" disabled="disabled">
                                    ただいま品切れ中です。
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        {% endif %}

                        {{ form.input('productCode')|raw }}
                        {{ form.input('csrfToken')|raw }}
                    </form>
                    <div class="ec-modal">
                        <div class="ec-modal-overlay">
                            <div class="ec-modal-wrap">
                                <span class="ec-modal-close"><span class="ec-icon"><img src="{{ asset('assets/icon/cross-dark.svg') }}" alt=""/></span></span>
                                <div id="ec-modal-header" class="text-center">カートに追加しました。</div>
                                <div class="ec-modal-box">
                                    <div class="ec-role">
                                        <span class="ec-inlineBtn--cancel">お買い物を続ける</span>
                                        <a href="/cart" class="ec-inlineBtn--action">カートへ進む</a>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ec-productRole__description">
                        {{ description|default('')|nl2br }}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
